      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The loop never sees the true state. It closes through an estimate, so every error in the sensors\nand the filter is an error the controller acts on. A simulator's one advantage over the real\nvehicle is that it knows both numbers, and can report the difference.",
      "originalText": "The loop never sees the true state. It closes through an estimate, so every error in the sensors\nand the filter is an error the controller acts on. A simulator's one advantage over the real\nvehicle is that it knows both numbers, and can report the difference.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
